defensebuild_gg 1 atril
defenseuse_gg 1 atril
idle_orders 119 64 1 atril 256 group_men 55 count(AtLeast 2 106 14)|WithoutUnitFlags(Air)
idle_orders 119 64 1 atril 256 group_men 70 count(AtLeast 3 106 14)|WithoutUnitFlags(Air)
idle_orders 119 64 1 atril 256 group_men 110 count(AtLeast 4 106 14)|WithoutUnitFlags(Air)
