build 1 defiler_mound 80
defensebuild_ag 1 defiler
defenseuse_ag 1 defiler
idle_orders 119 64 1 defiler 512 spawnsire 40 own|allied|notenemies|incombat
idle_orders 119 64 1 defiler 512 spawnsire|broodling 60 own|allied|notenemies|incombat|Count(AtLeast 6 80 14)
idle_orders 119 64 1 defiler 512 sy_demon 50 own|allied|notenemies|incombat|Count(AtLeast 2 80 14)
idle_orders 119 64 1 defiler 512 sy_demon 70 own|allied|notenemies|incombat|Count(AtLeast 4 80 14)
idle_orders 119 64 1 defiler 512 sy_demon 90 own|allied|notenemies|incombat|Count(AtLeast 7 100 14)
idle_orders 119 64 1 gray 192 group_men 55 count(AtLeast 2 80 14)|WithoutUnitFlags(Air)
idle_orders 119 64 1 gray 192 group_men 70 count(AtLeast 3 80 14)|WithoutUnitFlags(Air)
idle_orders 119 64 1 gray 192 group_men 110 count(AtLeast 4 80 14)|WithoutUnitFlags(Air)
